# Generated by patch.sh (or patch-oodle.sh, kept for compatibility and now an alias for it).
# LibProsperoPkg.dll itself is tracked and is never modified in place; these are the unified
# patched copy and its provenance stamp, the legacy Oodle-only patched copy and stamp from
# running tools/OodlePatcher directly, and the backend/shim assemblies copied in beside them.
